      "n": 1,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/91400137.png",
      "text": "\"To sakana lisano yako bombama pe kolukana,\" Ndeko na ngayi ya mobali alobi.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=33807#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:4f61f978bc4ef3416a91ef3c9d7d57306a1bbee52929037308de991c956d2f4e"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": null,
      "text": "Moko, mibale, misato, mineyi, mitano, motoba, sambo, mwambe, libwa, zomi, zomi na moko, zomi na mibale… ...tuku libwa na mibale, tuku libwa na misato, tuku libwa na mineyi, tuku libwa na mitano, tuku libwa na motoba, kama moko!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=33807#page=2",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:0494ef5b54dfcb904b61ed1f9076dba9a114b99db539036c631ebf36cac1d2dd"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/91400133.png",
      "text": "Ndeko na ngayi ya mobali azalaka koya. Nazalaka kobomba na sima ya elemba oyo ezipaka maninisa ya ndako.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=33807#page=3",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:9bac5e37d5bfbdc719b0319a633068582d77446804a37d1abdcb9cd9fb2f5e12"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/91400134.png",
      "text": "A lukaki ngayi bisika nioso na ndako.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=33807#page=4",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:e42b3dd0a6d8f2c60aa4bfd2a8fb6bf4d94ebc68a38732cb135cf65360d4802a"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/91400135.png",
      "text": "Ayaka na eteni ya ndako esika Nazalaka kobombama.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=33807#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:82fbf8195a0c841bd876a8058f086e256512c624353ef8570b4a4c6fb4046d6d"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "img": null,
      "text": "Nazalaka koninganate te. Nazalaka ko kanisa,\"Akomona ngayi.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=33807#page=6",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:68df6f4d6bcdc0ed6f52dc198c6dbab5c665c37d1f253c27c00cc46d3296c3e0"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/91400136.png",
      "text": "Na mwa tango moke abimaka libanda ya esika nazalaki yako bombama!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=33807#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:d89a7ec8580a8d8c36a1afe227ceec48735118319e17edbc78b33c2ab2fd502e"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/91400132.png",
      "text": "Na kimaka mbango libanda. Na gangaka, \"Omonigayi tee!\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=33807#page=8",
